# system-details cli-json --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposal, depends on §3.11 (not approved:$
# cmd/hardn/output.go:4): hardn system-details --output json. On$
# pkg/output's document, not beside it: --output json is one$
# flag with one contract (docs/reference/output.md), mode$
# "check" already means "read, change nothing", host already$
# holds the name and OS, and wire.go's SchemaVersion comment$
# lets a field be added without a new version. So the nine$
# fields, and one more, details, on this form alone; result$
# nothing-to-do, exit 0.$
$
